###
# Tokens
###
# Deliberately broader than the filenames actually in use. These files hold
# live access tokens and ICE credentials, so a near-miss filename must still be
# ignored rather than committed.
/src/utilities/token/e2e-*token*
/src/utilities/token/e2e-*ice-server*
/src/utilities/config/e2e-tests-default-suite-id*
